    "text": "By First Alert 4 Staff ,\n2 hours ago ST. LOUIS, Mo. (First Alert 4) - A water search and rescue was underway Wednesday evening at Castlewood State Park. The Metro West Fire Department told First Alert 4 five rescue boats and a full team were searching for a 19-year-old man. Officials told First Alert 4 that a reliable witness reported seeing the person go underwater. Read full article",
